          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕಡೆಗಣಿಸು — kaḍegaṇisu — \"to disregard; to overlook\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳು ಹಳ್ಳಿಯ ಸಮಸ್ಯೆಗಳನ್ನು ಕಡೆಗಣಿಸಿದರು. adhikārigaḷu haḷḷiya samasyegaḷannu kaḍegaṇisidaru. The officials disregarded the village's problems."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಕಡೆಗಣಿಸಿದೆ, kaḍegaṇiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is disregarded takes -ಅನ್ನು."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕಡೆಗಣಿಸು (kaḍegaṇisu) is built as a compound whose first part is native kaḍe, \"end, a low or inferior place\" (DEDR 1109), as in ಕಡಿಮೆ; the second part looks like ಗಣಿಸು, \"to count\", but how the word was formed is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
